[{"client_msg_id":"497eded2-f1f8-421d-8942-26b9571a03f0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"たぶん時限独占なので他の配信サイトでも後から配信されるだろう","ts":"1632053722.407000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0R8q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a975964f-c171-4f01-8944-8d1fa6e03253","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"FODでも見逃し配信されるのでは","ts":"1632053694.406100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I86J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be9537ee-e665-4821-919e-97ef53faf698","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あーあと鬼滅も一応秋アニメか","ts":"1632053418.405700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jboj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e91dbdb-77df-4784-a0d3-f01ad252d74b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"終末のハーレムの PV に年齢制限かかってるの草","ts":"1632053379.405600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IrRVT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d18865e-af61-4b09-a4b3-d706d4f9b559","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"配信はFODオンリーでしたっけ。\nめんどうだなぁ…","ts":"1632053336.405000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a48f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f655883-4945-4d8a-b077-54fdc187e00a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえず視聴確定してるのはゆゆゆとマブラヴかな\nマブラヴは配信が期待できないので録画環境を再整備しないと","ts":"1632052834.404100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UpoW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0240198b-dbd5-4e66-8dcd-8eff33330b52","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"フィットボクシング…","ts":"1632052748.403100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CHv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edb6c96c-4c96-426c-beba-f6fd218ebf97","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"180秒で君の耳を幸せにできるか気になる。全話asmrなのかな? ダミヘになるのだろうか?","ts":"1632046359.402700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dmV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b13d3e86-020e-44c8-b63d-67635c807970","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、ワートリ3rdあるんだ","ts":"1632046312.401900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h8VRM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b65a4b66-ee42-4430-a424-ea31b66ce6b4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今季は追いかけてたプロジェクトや漫画がアニメ化されるので嬉しい","ts":"1632046298.401500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C4sDP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f23ac42-3f8e-4827-8361-f4debf24b5dd","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"ロボット物が多くてうれしい。\n境界戦機とマヴラヴはとりあえず見よう","ts":"1632045790.398800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FF1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb5c4ce2-a72c-4b41-8f68-d482bd2560fd","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"ブルーピリオドの人気が出たらアフタヌーンつながりでフラジャイルもアニメ化しないかと期待してます（そういうつながりは難しそう）","ts":"1632045160.398000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e0DTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9b06189-3940-41f2-af6b-90b9d7adf69d","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"最果てのパラディン は良いコミカライズでした。\nアニメがどうなるのかちょっと気になります。","ts":"1632045081.397000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lR+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ceb9b32-1670-434e-ade8-8728dc4b888a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ブルーピリオドは漫画が人気高いですね","ts":"1632045074.396900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8X+g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71efec8d-ee88-425b-8d69-575082f5406f","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"とりあえず聞いたことがあるのはそれくらいですねえ。他になにかおすすめあったら教えて下さい。","ts":"1632044911.395600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dtz+w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d1cc9b7-4652-42b8-80a3-dcdb01c81cd6","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"先輩がうざい後輩の話は見ると思います","ts":"1632044882.395300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UHf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"977fa08a-bb3e-4836-ad34-53f2af7f4794","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"コミュ症、なぜか NHK で実写ドラマをやっているのを見かけたことがあります","ts":"1632044866.395100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"990beef9-6bfe-4461-ba3f-4c9cca6c6653","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"無職転生の2クール目が始まるんですね","ts":"1632044828.394700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FuE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e32f4cf-7be5-463a-bc79-9e2ed06e27ca","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"\u003chttps://gigazine.net/news/20210918-anime-2021autumn/\u003e","ts":"1632044635.394200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GIGAZINE: 2021年秋開始の新作アニメ一覧","id":1,"title":"2021年秋開始の新作アニメ一覧","title_link":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210918-anime-2021autumn/","text":"年4回の番組改編期で、また多数の新作アニメが始まります。2021年秋の改編でスタートするアニメの本数は約60本。","image_url":"https://i.gzn.jp/img/2021/09/18/anime-2021autumn/00.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"GIGAZINE","service_icon":"https://gigazine.net/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210918-anime-2021autumn/","original_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210918-anime-2021autumn/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"re